<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Key Energy started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Key Energy started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it initiated coverage of Key Energy Group Inc as a buy.</p>
<p>-- said believes Key Energy has one of the best management team in the oil services industry.</p>
<p>-- said believes acquisition trend to continue.</p>
<p>-- said expects company to provide an average of 46 percent earnings per share growth from fiscal 1996 through fiscal 1999.</p>
<p>-- Key Energy gained 11/16 to 19-9/16.</p>
</text>
